{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23528","headline":"与皇甫庶子同游城东 · 白居易","name":"与皇甫庶子同游城东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲游何必多徒侣，相劝时时举一桮。\n博望苑中无职役，建春门外足池台。\n绿油剪叶蒲新长，红蜡黏枝杏欲开。\n白马朱衣两宫相，可怜天气出城来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}